Source attribution
==================

This portfolio implementation is based on the 2026 bachelor thesis:
"Применение алгоритмов машинного обучения для анализа и прогнозирования
результатов футбольных матчей" by Эркинов Дурбек Кахрамон угли
(Durbek Erkinov), Lomonosov Moscow State University, Tashkent branch.

The project reconstructs the method and code fragments documented in that work,
with data validation against the subsequently supplied original project archive,
football_match_prediction_project.rar.
Repository organization, CLI, validation, reporting and persistence integration
were prepared for this portfolio. See docs/PROVENANCE.md for the boundaries.

The GitHub-ready ZIP does not include the thesis PDF, original datasets, or model
weights. Local prepared data and trained weights are excluded from Git. The
repository includes measured aggregate evaluation reports and charts.
